    },
    "This app is intended for educational and informational purposes only and is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a qualified healthcare provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition. \n\nAll data, references, and methodologies used in the app are transparently documented. You can review the full list of citations and supporting materials down below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This app is intended for educational and informational purposes only and is not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a qualified healthcare provider with any questions you may have regarding a medical condition. \n\nAll data, references, and methodologies used in the app are transparently documented. You can review the full list of citations and supporting materials down below."
          }
        },
        "es-419" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Esta aplicación tiene fines exclusivamente educativos e informativos y no sustituye el consejo, diagnóstico ni tratamiento médico profesional. Si tienes alguna pregunta sobre una afección médica, consulta siempre con un profesional de la salud cualificado.\n\nTodos los datos, referencias y metodologías utilizados en la aplicación están documentados de forma transparente. Puedes consultar la lista completa de citas y materiales de apoyo a continuación."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This simulator is just a tool to learn, not a diagnosis. Consult your doctor." : {
